                                                "sense_id": "ff691de8-d97d-3245-b177-b63c5929a3a3",
                                                "text": "She wore a tattered jean jacket."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5e3fc14-6836-4bab-a508-3b8740711adc",
                                                "sense_id": "ff691de8-d97d-3245-b177-b63c5929a3a3",
                                                "text": "Lastly, he took out a common frock of coarse dark jean, which he drew over his own under-clothing; and a felt hat—he had purposely left his own upstairs."
                                            }
